@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #315E57
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #315E57
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #D8EEE5
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #789D94
autonumber

actor "经理" as Manager
boundary "经营与待办界面" as UI
control "查看经营与待办控制" as Control
entity "预约与办理任务" as ServiceTask
entity "租赁合同" as Contract
entity "装备" as Equipment
entity "维修工单" as RepairOrder
entity "经营统计" as Statistics

Manager -> UI : 提交统计条件(日期、门店)
UI -> Control : 查看经营与待办(统计条件)
activate Control
Control -> ServiceTask : 提供排队与办理数据(统计范围)
ServiceTask --> Control : 返回队列、当前环节和办理时长
Control -> Contract : 提供租赁数据(统计范围)
Contract --> Control : 返回交付日期、取件门店及合同租金
Control -> Equipment : 提供状态数据(统计范围)
Equipment --> Control : 返回装备状态数据
Control -> RepairOrder : 提供维修数据(统计范围)
RepairOrder --> Control : 返回维修数据
Control -> Statistics : 汇总经营指标(业务数据)
Statistics -> Statistics : 汇总交付单数、约定租金与利用率()
Statistics -> Statistics : 核对等待样本，跨日或缺失则提示待核对
Statistics -> Statistics : 其他业务数量收进明细
Statistics -> Statistics : 汇总异常待办()
Statistics -> Statistics : 生成超时预警(等待时长、支付、归还、维修)
Statistics --> Control : 返回经营指标、待办、预警和数据截止时间
Control --> UI : 返回经营信息、待办与超时预警
deactivate Control
UI --> Manager : 展示经营信息、待办与超时预警
@enduml
